{"id":"n62400-1-17","stage":1,"title":"노력 · 努力","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62400-1-17-1","ko":"지난달에 비해 성적이 내려갔구나.","zh":"和上个月相比，成绩下降了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난달에","meaning":"上月，上个月","explanation":"지난달：上月，上个月；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난달","audio":"/audio/4ef0b7b8e3c716651a62.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26900","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난달에","audio":"/audio/0ce5c64d5580f7509296.mp3"}},{"text":"비해","meaning":"相比","explanation":"비하다：相比；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"비하다","audio":"/audio/f5d55c30842200d89171.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15641","senseId":"3","lemma":"비하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비해","audio":"/audio/71a7453acd8ba8fcae2b.mp3"}},{"text":"성적이","meaning":"成绩","explanation":"성적：成绩；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"성적","audio":"/audio/cc5bf6a36796ed18e880.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64457","senseId":"2","lemma":"성적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성적이","audio":"/audio/234b1582309443aa42ff.mp3"}},{"text":"내려갔구나.","meaning":"下跌，下降","explanation":"내려가다：下跌，下降；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"내려가다","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63723","senseId":"7","lemma":"내려가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내려갔구나","audio":"/audio/987eea1dfee168d484a3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4ef0b7b8e3c71665","term":"지난달","zh":"上月，上个月","audio":"/audio/4ef0b7b8e3c716651a62.mp3","entryId":"26900","definition":"本月的前一月。","pronunciation":["지난달"]},{"id":"f5d55c30842200d8","term":"비하다","zh":"相比","audio":"/audio/f5d55c30842200d89171.mp3","entryId":"15641","definition":"以某个基准来看时，不到那个基准。","pronunciation":["비ː하다"]},{"id":"cc5bf6a36796ed18","term":"성적","zh":"成绩","audio":"/audio/cc5bf6a36796ed18e880.mp3","entryId":"64457","definition":"通过考试对学生的学习进行评价的结果。","pronunciation":["성적"]},{"id":"d27a99abb5cf233c","term":"내려가다","zh":"下跌，下降","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3","entryId":"63723","definition":"价格、统计数据、温度或物价等降下来。","pronunciation":["내려가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1e223daf2ea5e45f56eb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62400-1-17-2","ko":"제 노력이 부족했던 것 같습니다.","zh":"看来是我自己的努力不够啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"노력이","meaning":"努力，下工夫","explanation":"노력：努力，下工夫；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"노력","audio":"/audio/1119b060db74766fb336.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62400","senseId":"1","lemma":"노력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노력이","audio":"/audio/5cee04a86c5d3aafd0b6.mp3"}},{"text":"부족했던","meaning":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","explanation":"부족하다：不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"부족하다","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59849","senseId":"1","lemma":"부족하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부족했던","audio":"/audio/7bc9ea5d6e8afea4e771.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같습니다.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같습니다","audio":"/audio/70b461d79f2fe5361c4